# 2. Your architecture

I'd build this:

```text
                    ┌─────────────────────┐
                    │     USER / CxO      │
                    │ "Investigate my     │
                    │ suspicious charge"  │
                    └──────────┬──────────┘
                               │
                               ▼
                    ┌─────────────────────┐
                    │    Triage Agent     │
                    │                     │
                    │ Intent Detection    │
                    │ Risk Classification │
                    └──────────┬──────────┘
                               │
                     Delegation Request
                               │
                               ▼
              ┌────────────────────────────────┐
              │   IDENTITY GOVERNANCE LAYER    │
              │                                │
              │ Identity                       │
              │ Delegation                     │
              │ Capability                     │
              │ Policy                         │
              │ Provenance                     │
              │ Revocation                     │
              └───────────────┬────────────────┘
                              │
                       Authorized?
                       /           \
                     YES            NO
                      │              │
                      ▼              ▼
              ┌────────────┐      DENY
              │ Fraud      │
              │ Agent      │
              └─────┬──────┘
                    │
             Tool invocation
                    │
                    ▼
          ┌──────────────────────┐
          │   SANDBOX / MCP      │
          │                      │
          │ Filesystem           │
          │ Process              │
          │ Network              │
          │ Runtime Policy       │
          └──────────┬───────────┘
                     │
                     ▼
              Banking APIs
```

The important architectural separation comes directly from your source:

**Identity Governance → "Should this agent be allowed to perform this action?"**

**Sandbox → "Can this process technically perform this action?"** 

