# 4. The most important feature: delegation

The customer doesn't directly call the Fraud Agent.

Instead:

```text
Customer
   │
   │ request
   ▼
Triage Agent
   │
   │ delegates
   ▼
Fraud Agent
   │
   │ requests
   ▼
Transaction API
```

The governance system records:

```json
{
  "originator": "customer-1001",
  "current_agent": "fraud-agent",
  "delegated_by": "triage-agent",
  "purpose": "fraud-investigation",
  "action": "transaction.read",
  "resource": "customer-1001",
  "decision": "ALLOW"
}
```

This directly demonstrates your **provenance** concept. 

