# 8. Demo Scenario #4 — Tool-chain escalation

This is another excellent leadership demonstration.

Give an agent two legitimate permissions:

```text
Tool A
transaction.read

Tool B
email.send
```

Individually:

```text
transaction.read  → ALLOW

email.send        → ALLOW
```

But the agent attempts:

```text
READ
customer transactions
       │
       ▼
Extract sensitive information
       │
       ▼
SEND
to external destination
```

Your governance engine should evaluate the **workflow context**, not merely each API call.

```text
READ → ALLOW

EXTERNAL SEND
      ↓
Workflow policy
      ↓
Sensitive data leaving boundary
      ↓
🚫 DENY
```

This illustrates why your architecture proposes workflow-level policy evaluation. 

